{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788039422936880001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"wormlike-buried-grunion","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"31e22d720d0ac0be011a25744a426fa1be1aae80c49221c2f5cb69fa0600eee5","event_uuid":"b09ef5b4-975a-40f0-bc78-f39662548a3c","position":{"commit_sha":"1221f1fb2f1ab602d97c0ef16d8283248fa3690f","position":"1788033535832514921-b09ef5b4-975a-40f0-bc78-f39662548a3c"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"8c7686578b2b0c5614835bd117abe803c56e6cf172e2befc120861c22966c25c","event_uuid":"a87f69ce-a021-4967-8f9f-e277680d802f","position":{"commit_sha":"cec1f8ef82e184b5d53f22770665b719580787f6","position":"1788033567612808024-a87f69ce-a021-4967-8f9f-e277680d802f"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"0b260302cc1ca2ebec5b27dea2c794dec7256b0e0d14468991456c3e362de159","event_uuid":"963be9ce-b62c-4ed9-8c84-5fb97a2112c8","position":{"commit_sha":"76b4943e9aefde35ac2771399bc7b9d78b9bf214","position":"1788033591983600821-963be9ce-b62c-4ed9-8c84-5fb97a2112c8"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788033535832514921,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"963be9ce-b62c-4ed9-8c84-5fb97a2112c8","relation":"blocks","target_id":"e9d5-c850-d505-4a5a"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nThe typed reconciler payload work (earthborn-statuelike-boutu) introduces a named direction/action payload union and threads it through the planner, coordinator, and adapter-projection seam. The modules that build and project those payloads are already within a handful of lines of the hard 800-LOC module-size cap (`.github/module-size-limit.txt` = 800), so that expand would breach the CI module-size gate on first edit:\n\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/run_differs.py` = 798 (43 payload/mutation references)\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/outbound_differ.py` = 793\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/applier.py` = 793\n\nCreate headroom FIRST as a behavior-preserving extraction along existing call-graph seams, so the typed cutover lands without fighting the module-size gate. This story adds no typed-payload logic; it only relocates existing clusters.\n\n## Approach\n\nExtract cohesive, already-clustered helpers into sibling modules per the AGENTS.md module-size policy (existing call-graph seams only; target 200-500 LOC; never create a module < 100 LOC; never split mechanically to hit a number):\n\n- `run_differs.py`: move the self-contained outbound sub-pass (`_run_differs_outbound` plus its alert emitters `_emit_outbound_field_alerts` / `_emit_recovery_failure_alerts`) into a sibling module.\n- `outbound_differ.py`: move the memoized effective-mapping resolvers (`_memoize_effective`, `_effective_status_map_for`, `_effective_type_map_for`, `_effective_priority_map_for`, `_effective_create_defaults_for`, `_effective_link_map_for`, `_effective_excluded_sync_types_for`) into a sibling module.\n- `applier.py`: move the batch-execution cluster (`_apply_batch`, `_apply_one`, `_print_batch_recon`) or the cross-project/drift cluster (`HeadDriftError`, `CrossProjectTargetError`, `_cross_project_targets`, `_recheck_drift`) into a sibling module.\n\nPublic entry points and import paths keep working; only internal call sites move.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/` — extract the named clusters into new sibling modules and update imports only.\n- `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/` — import-path updates only; no assertion changes.\n\n## Testing\n\nExisting reconciler unit/integration suites pass unchanged (behavior-preserving). Module-size gate and per-function complexity ratchet pass. Lint and typecheck pass. No new CI-provider, network, Docker, or Jira dependency is introduced (portable default suite).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `run_differs.py`, `outbound_differ.py`, and `applier.py` are each comfortably below 800 LOC (target <= 700) with room for the typed union, achieved only by extracting existing call-graph clusters into sibling modules.\n- [ ] No newly created module is below 100 LOC, and no extraction is mechanical: each sibling is a cluster whose members already called one another.\n- [ ] Behavior is unchanged: existing reconciler test suites pass with no edits beyond import paths.\n- [ ] Module-size gate, per-function complexity ratchet, lint, and typecheck all pass.\n- [ ] No production write-route change and no typed-payload/union logic is introduced here; that remains earthborn-statuelike-boutu.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/run_differs.py","reason":"Extract outbound sub-pass cluster (_run_differs_outbound + alert emitters) into a sibling to create headroom before the typed cutover."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/outbound_differ.py","reason":"Extract memoized effective-mapping resolvers into a sibling to create headroom."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/applier.py","reason":"Extract the batch-execution / drift cluster into a sibling to create headroom."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["blocks","e9d5-c850-d505-4a5a"],["parent","eb64-844b-ab7a-4915"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"eb64-844b-ab7a-4915","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["reconciler","refactor","module-size"],"ticket_id":"7153-e5ad-5e20-4ae9","ticket_type":"story","title":"Create reconciler payload-path module-size headroom before the typed-payload cutover","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["b09ef5b4-975a-40f0-bc78-f39662548a3c","a87f69ce-a021-4967-8f9f-e277680d802f","963be9ce-b62c-4ed9-8c84-5fb97a2112c8"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788039422936880001,"uuid":"883b94eb-48b1-43a2-81a9-207e7f7a7078"}